    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d252">

                <pb facs="0638" n="591" xml:id="pg591"/>

                <head>252. Airgram From the Embassy in Haiti to the Department of State<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d252-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <idno type="document-identifier">A–50</idno>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>Port au Prince</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1978-07-25">July 25, 1978</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>A Different View on U.S. Policy Towards Haiti by Two Departing
                        Officers</item>
                </list>
                <p>Enclosed for the Department’s information is a personal view on what U.S. policy
                    should be towards Haiti as prepared by two officers departing post. These views
                    do not reflect Embassy policy, but Ambassador Jones authorized submission of their views in this form. The
                    Embassy will submit its comment on these views in a separate message.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#bold">Meade</hi></signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d252-a1.xml" xpointer="d252-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
